---
title: Transaction detail request sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(173,216,230) Compute
        participant LegendCompute as Compute
        participant CardServicingUi
        participant ApiGateway
        participant CardServicingService
    end
    box rgb(144,238,144) Data stores
        participant LegendDataStores as Data stores
        participant AzureManagedRedis
    end
    box rgb(211,211,211) External systems
        participant LegendExternal as External systems
        participant AuthService
        participant ConfigService
        participant TransactionActivityService
        participant CardDataService
    end
    box rgb(244,204,204) Security
        participant LegendSecurity as Security
        participant AccountAccessGuard
    end
    box rgb(255,255,224) Networking
        participant LegendNetworking as Networking
    end

    CardServicingUi->>ApiGateway: GET transaction detail
    ApiGateway->>CardServicingService: Forward with bearer token
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Start 900 ms deadline and traceId
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Read held config snapshot
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Validate accountId and transactionId
    alt invalid accountId or transactionId
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 400 ErrorObject with traceId
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 400 with no upstream call
    end

    CardServicingService->>AccountAccessGuard: Check token and account access
    AccountAccessGuard->>AuthService: ValidateToken
    alt token valid
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: Subject and roles
    else token invalid
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: UNAUTHENTICATED
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Token rejected
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 401 ErrorObject with traceId
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 401 with no data read
    else Auth unavailable or deadline spent
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Fail closed
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504 with no data read
    end

    AccountAccessGuard->>AuthService: AuthorizeAccountAccess
    alt allowed true
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: allowed true
    else allowed false
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: allowed false
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Access denied
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 403 ErrorObject with traceId
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 403 with no data read
    else Auth unavailable or deadline spent
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Fail closed
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504 with no data read
    end
    AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Access allowed

    opt stale configuration snapshot
        CardServicingService-)ConfigService: GetConfig background refresh
    end

    par transaction
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Read cached transaction
        AzureManagedRedis-->>CardServicingService: Entry or miss
        opt miss or stale entry
            CardServicingService->>TransactionActivityService: GetTransaction on miss or stale
            TransactionActivityService-->>CardServicingService: Transaction or NOT_FOUND
            CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Store found transaction with cachedAt
        end
    and cross-reference
        CardServicingService->>CardDataService: GetCardCrossReference
        CardDataService-->>CardServicingService: Card numbers on account
    end
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Match transaction card to account
    Note over CardServicingService: Cut-off at or before 900 ms

    alt card belongs to account
        CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Resolve dataStatus and asOf
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 200 transaction detail
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 200 with dataStatus FRESH or STALE
    else not found or card not on account
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 404 ErrorObject with traceId
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 404 NOT_FOUND
    else transaction read failed with no usable entry
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504
    else cross-reference read failed
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 even with cached transaction
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504
    end

    Note over LegendCompute,LegendNetworking: The service validates the request and checks access, then reads the transaction and the account card cross-references concurrently. A transaction whose card number is not on the account returns 404.
